      "type": "data_flow",
      "old_value": "The block is never mutated by the user-data lifecycle. Its diagnostic strings are consumed only by the HSD_ASSERT paths: initialization uses the empty-slot predicate text if registration is attempted on an occupied object, and removal uses the callback predicate text if registered data lacks a removal function. Normal execution instead reads and writes the HSD_GObj fields and does not consume this data.",
