      "old_value": "Receives a caller-owned payload pointer, its u8 kind, and a cleanup callback; after validating the destination object is unoccupied, it copies them without transformation into HSD_GObj::user_data, user_data_kind, and user_data_remove_func respectively. It returns no value and does not invoke the callback during registration.",
