      },
      "type": "state_behavior",
      "old_value": "If user_data_kind is HSD_GOBJ_USER_DATA_NONE, the function returns without side effects. Otherwise it asserts that user_data_remove_func is non-NULL, invokes the callback before changing the registration fields, and then transitions the object to the no-user-data state by setting user_data_kind to HSD_GOBJ_USER_DATA_NONE and user_data to NULL; the stored callback is not reset.",
