      "type": "data_flow",
      "old_value": "Registration copies a caller-owned payload pointer, u8 kind, and type-erased cleanup callback into HSD_GObj. Removal reads that metadata, passes the stored payload to the stored callback, then writes HSD_GOBJ_USER_DATA_NONE to the kind and NULL to the payload pointer; it leaves user_data_remove_func unchanged.",
