      "type": "state_behavior",
      "old_value": "The subsystem has an empty state represented by user_data_kind == HSD_GOBJ_USER_DATA_NONE and a registered state represented by any other kind. Initialization asserts that the object is empty before installing metadata. Removal is a no-op in the empty state; otherwise it requires a non-NULL removal callback, invokes it while the payload remains registered, and then returns the object to the empty state by clearing the kind and payload.",
